stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Moving : arrow key pressed
    Moving --> Collecting : lands on item tile
    Collecting --> Powered : power item collected
    Collecting --> Idle : regular item collected
    Powered --> Moving : continue movement
    Moving --> HitByEnemy : enemy collision without power
    Powered --> DefeatEnemy : enemy collision while powered
    DefeatEnemy --> Moving
    HitByEnemy --> Respawn : lose life and reset position
    Respawn --> Idle
    Powered --> Idle : power timer ends
